00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:25,600
Here we have a really simple broken demo app with some tests that are failing.

204
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,440
So let's ask the model to fix it.

205
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,799
The tests in this project are failing.

206
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,639
Find out why and fix the code.

207
00:15:30,639 --> 00:15:35,439
And here we can see the model responding with tool calls that it can run and then it gets the results of those.

208
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:38,720
It runs another, it gets the results, and then it says something.

209
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,439
Two bugs.

